  "tip_es": "Groups like pr, br, tr, dr, cr, gr, pl, bl, cl, gl and fl are pronounced together, with no vowel between them: trabajo, problema, blanco. A common mistake is to add a small vowel inside the group (“tarabajo”). Say both consonants in one smooth movement.",
